[{"category":"section","location":"#SimpleBLE.jl","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"Documentation for SimpleBLE.jl","title":"SimpleBLE.jl"},{"category":"method","location":"#Base.notify-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"notify(callback,\n\tperipheral::Peripheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n)\nnotify(\n\tperipheral::Peripheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n) do data\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when data is received from a Characteristic. notify is generally faster than indicate because it does not need to acknowledge that it received the data.\n\nwarning: Warning\nWARNING: YOU MUST NOT PASS THE data VECTOR OUTSIDE THE CALLBACK, IT IS NOT VALID AFTER THE CALLBACK FINISHES, IF YOU NEED TO KEEP THE DATA AFTER THE CALLBACK IS FINISHED, COPY IT!\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"Base.notify"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.address-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"address(adapter)\n\nGet the address of an adapter.\n\nSee also identifier\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.address"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.address-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"address(peripheral)\n\nGet the address of a peripheral.\n\nSee also identifier\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.address"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.connect-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"connect(peripheral) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nConvenience function for automatically disconnecting from a peripheral once you're done with it\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.connect"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.connect-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"connect(peripheral)\n\nConnect to a peripheral. Generally you should disconnect when you're done with it\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.connect"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.find_peripheral-Tuple{Any, Any}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"find_peripheral(matchfunc, adapter)\nfind_peripheral(adapter) do identifier::String\n\t# Stuff\n\treturn output::Bool\nend\n\nConvenience function for finding a peripheral. identifier is the name of the peripheral, it can be an empty string.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.find_peripheral"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.get_adapter-Tuple{Any}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"get_adapter(i)\n\nAcquire a handle to an adapter. i is an index starting at 0. You can check the number of adapters with adapter_get_count.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.get_adapter"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.identifier-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"identifier(adapter)\n\nGet the name of an adapter.\n\nSee also address\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.identifier"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.identifier-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"identifier(peripheral)\n\nGet the name of a peripheral.\n\nSee also address\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.identifier"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.indicate-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"indicate(callback,\n\tperipheral::Peripheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n)\nindicate(\n\tperipheral::Peripheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n) do data\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when data is received from a Characteristic. notify is generally faster than indicate because it does not need to acknowledge that it received the data.\n\nwarning: Warning\nWARNING: YOU MUST NOT PASS THE data VECTOR OUTSIDE THE CALLBACK, IT IS NOT VALID AFTER THE CALLBACK FINISHES, IF YOU NEED TO KEEP THE DATA AFTER THE CALLBACK IS FINISHED, COPY IT!\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.indicate"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.manufacturer_data-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"manufacturer_data(peripheral)\n\nAcquire the manufacturer data associated with peripheral.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.manufacturer_data"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.peripheral_read-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"peripheral_read(peripheral, service, characteristic)\n\nRead data from a characteristic.\n\nservice and characteristic can be AbstractStrings, SBLEUUIDs, or SBLESERVICE and SBLECHARACTERISTIC acquired by services.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.peripheral_read"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.read_descriptor-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"read_descriptor(\n\tperipheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC},\n\tdescriptor::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n)\n\nRead data from a descriptor.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.read_descriptor"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.scan_for-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter, Any}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"scan_for(adapter, timeout_ms)\n\nScan for a specified number of ms. Results can be acquired with scan_get_results. Or check each peripheral found or updated inside a callback set by set_callback_on_scan_found\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.scan_for"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.scan_get_results-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"scan_get_results(adapter)\n\nGet the results of a scan.\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.scan_get_results"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.scan_start-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"scan_start(adapter)\n\nStart scanning for peripherals. Results can be acquired with scan_get_results. Or check each peripheral found or updated inside a callback set by set_callback_on_scan_found\n\nSee also scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.scan_start"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.scan_stop-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"Stop a scan\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.scan_stop"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.services-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"services(peripheral)\n\nAcquire the services provided by a peripheral.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.services"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_connected-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_connected(callback, peripheral)\nset_callback_on_connected(peripheral) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when a peripheral is connected.\n\nSee also set_callback_on_disconnected\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_connected"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_disconnected-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Peripheral}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_disconnected(peripheral) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when a peripheral is disconnected.\n\nSee also set_callback_on_connected\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_disconnected"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_power_off-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_power_off(adapter) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter is powered off.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_power_off"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_power_on-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_power_on(adapter) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter is powered on.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_power_on"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_found-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_scan_found(adapter) do peripheral\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter finds a peripheral.\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_found"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_start-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_scan_start(adapter) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter starts scanning.\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_start"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_stop-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_scan_stop(adapter) do\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter stops scanning.\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_stop"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_updated-Tuple{Any, SimpleBLE.Adapter}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"set_callback_on_scan_updated(adapter) do peripheral\n\t# Stuff\nend\n\nSet a callback that is called when an adapter updates a peripheral.\n\nSee also scan_start, scan_stop, scan_for\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.set_callback_on_scan_updated"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.unsubscribe-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"unsubscribe(\n\tperipheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC}\n)\n\nunsubscribe from a notify or indicate call.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.unsubscribe"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.write_command-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, Any}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"write_command(\n\tperipheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC},\n\tdata<: AbstractArray\n)\n\nWrite a command to a characteristic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.write_command"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.write_descriptor-Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, Any}","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"write_descriptor(\n\tperipheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC},\n\tdescriptor::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC},\n\tdata <: AbstractArray\n)\n\nWrite data to a descriptor.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.write_descriptor"},{"category":"method","location":"#SimpleBLE.write_request-Union{Tuple{A}, Tuple{SimpleBLE.Peripheral, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID, A}} where A<:AbstractArray","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"write_request(peripheral,\n\tservice::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLESERVICE},\n\tcharacteristic::Union{AbstractString, SBLEUUID, SBLECHARACTERISTIC},\n\tdata<:AbstractArray\n)\n\nWrite a request to a characteristic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.write_request"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.Adapter","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"A handle for an adapter that enables bluetooth connectivity on the device\n\nCan be acquired with get_adapter(i)\n\nWindows currently only supports one adapter with i = 0\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.Adapter"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.Peripheral","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"A handle for a bluetooth device. You can acquire a specific peripheral by using find_peripheral or get a list of all found peripherals with scan_get_results\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.Peripheral"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.SBLECHARACTERISTIC","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"Can be written to with writerequest and writecommand along with it's associated SBLESERVICE\n\nYou can check what Characteristics a peripheral has with services Often a peripheral will not advertise it's services unless it is connected\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.SBLECHARACTERISTIC"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.SBLEMANUFACTURERDATA","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"Arbitrary data about a peripheral that can be acquired with manufacturer_data\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.SBLEMANUFACTURERDATA"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.SBLESERVICE","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"You can check what Services a peripheral has with services. Often a peripheral will not advertise it's services unless it is connected\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.SBLESERVICE"},{"category":"type","location":"#SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID","page":"SimpleBLE.jl","text":"Basically just a fixed length string but can be anything really\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"SimpleBLE.SBLEUUID"}]
